.TH tkusqlite n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkusqlite
.PP
SQLite table browser. Lists the tables of a database on the left and shows the rows of the selected table on the right.
.PP
Optional widget. The \fBsqlite3\fR package is an external dependency and is \fInot\fR part of tclutils, so tkusqlite is not loaded by the tkutils umbrella. Ensure sqlite3 is installed, then \fBpackage require tkutils::tkusqlite\fR.
.SS API
.CS
set w [::tkutils::tkusqlite::widget .w ?-height N?]
::tkutils::tkusqlite::openFile  $w dbfile     ;# ":memory:" allowed; returns table count
::tkutils::tkusqlite::tables    $w
::tkutils::tkusqlite::showTable $w tablename  ;# returns row count
::tkutils::tkusqlite::getRows   $w
::tkutils::tkusqlite::closeDb   $w
.CE
.SS Launcher
.CS
tclsh bin/tkusqlite.tcl database.db
.CE
